    "File Cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files you open are kept here, so opening them again is instant unless they changed on the remote. When the cache is full, the least recently opened files are removed. A custom location gets its own “%@” folder. Edits to cached copies are not uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你打开过的文件会保存在这里，除非远程上的文件已更改，否则再次打开会立即完成。缓存已满时，会移除最久未打开的文件。自定义位置中会创建单独的“%@”文件夹。对缓存副本的修改不会被上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Filter this folder": {
      "localizations": {
