      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size of the exported copy cached on this Mac. Google Docs, Sheets and Slides have no fixed size on Drive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 上缓存的导出副本的大小。Google 文档、表格和幻灯片在云端硬盘中没有固定大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size unknown until opened — Google Docs, Sheets and Slides have no fixed size on Drive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开前大小未知——Google 文档、表格和幻灯片在云端硬盘中没有固定大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skipped: the local folder is empty, so syncing would delete everything on the remote.": {
      "localizations": {
